1
00:00:00,841 --> 00:00:02,843
[opening theme song playing]

2
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:30,620
BLUE BOX

3
00:01:31,056 --> 00:01:34,184
EPISODE 14
WHAT'S THE CONNECTION?

4
00:01:34,267 --> 00:01:35,936
[coach] Our second game is tomorrow.

5
00:01:36,728 --> 00:01:39,856
We will be facing
last year's champion, Minatozaki.

6
00:01:40,524 --> 00:01:43,443
Frankly, this is going to be
a tough one for us.

7
00:01:44,194 --> 00:01:46,446
But they're not unbeatable.

8
00:01:47,906 --> 00:01:49,825
Keep your heads in the game, everyone.

9
00:01:49,908 --> 00:01:51,034
[all] Yes, sir!

10
00:01:51,535 --> 00:01:52,953
[indistinct chatter]

11
00:01:53,036 --> 00:01:54,454
[pleasant music playing]

12
00:01:56,331 --> 00:01:58,208
- [Kikuchi] Nagisa, Chinatsu.
- [both] Huh?

13
00:01:58,834 --> 00:02:00,585
I'm counting on you tomorrow.

14
00:02:01,586 --> 00:02:05,465
Our first win was thanks to the points
that you both put on the board.

15
00:02:05,549 --> 00:02:08,593
But those only happened
'cause of assists from the other players!

16
00:02:09,219 --> 00:02:11,847
Okay, then this time,
score without an assist.

17
00:02:12,430 --> 00:02:13,348
[grunts]

18
00:02:14,766 --> 00:02:17,269
So nonchalant and yet so savage.

19
00:02:17,352 --> 00:02:18,228
[grunts]

20
00:02:18,937 --> 00:02:19,938
[Nagisa sighs]

21
00:02:20,814 --> 00:02:23,108
By the way, did you hear the rumor?

22
00:02:23,817 --> 00:02:26,444
It sounds like Yoshitani and Koike

23
00:02:26,528 --> 00:02:28,613
are going to retire after nationals.

24
00:02:28,697 --> 00:02:29,990
What?

25
00:02:30,073 --> 00:02:32,117
They gotta focus on entrance exams.

26
00:02:33,493 --> 00:02:35,453
That's why we need to do well,

27
00:02:35,537 --> 00:02:38,039
so they can keep playing
as long as possible.

28
00:02:43,795 --> 00:02:46,464
I haven't confirmed it all
with the two of them myself yet,

29
00:02:46,548 --> 00:02:47,716
- I heard it arou--
- [rustling]

30
00:02:47,799 --> 00:02:48,633
Huh?

31
00:02:50,594 --> 00:02:52,137
[Nagisa] <i>Roly-poly Natsu?</i>

32
00:02:52,220 --> 00:02:53,179
FYI!

33
00:02:53,263 --> 00:02:55,849
<i>I haven't seen this
since our last game of junior high.</i>

34
00:02:55,932 --> 00:02:57,392
{\an8}CHINATSU CURLS UP UNDER PRESSURE!

35
00:02:58,184 --> 00:02:59,436
Hello in there.

36
00:02:59,519 --> 00:03:02,397
You don't have to bear this
all on your own, you know.

37
00:03:06,151 --> 00:03:07,444
I can't help it.

38
00:03:08,778 --> 00:03:11,656
[Nagisa sighs] <i>It's 'cause
she keeps her feelings inside.</i>

39
00:03:13,033 --> 00:03:17,746
<i>I mean, she finally made it to nationals,
but it meant not living with her family.</i>

40
00:03:18,872 --> 00:03:20,707
<i>And she may be a second-year,</i>

41
00:03:20,790 --> 00:03:22,792
<i>but she's a promising scorer,</i>

42
00:03:22,876 --> 00:03:25,503
<i>so she must be feeling
the pressure more than anyone.</i>

43
00:03:26,338 --> 00:03:28,131
[mellow music playing]

44
00:03:30,926 --> 00:03:31,801
Nagisa.

45
00:03:33,094 --> 00:03:34,804
Basketball is fun, right?

46
00:03:35,513 --> 00:03:36,431
Well, duh.

47
00:03:36,932 --> 00:03:38,183
Yeah... duh.

48
00:03:42,979 --> 00:03:44,522
[Chinatsu] Up until nationals,

49
00:03:44,606 --> 00:03:47,525
I had doubts
lurking in every corner of my mind.

50
00:03:49,069 --> 00:03:51,738
But then we played the first game,
and won,

51
00:03:51,821 --> 00:03:54,199
and I had such an adrenaline rush.

52
00:03:54,282 --> 00:03:55,450
Totally.

53
00:03:56,076 --> 00:03:57,744
But that was only possible

54
00:03:57,827 --> 00:04:00,705
because of all the time
we spent practicing.

55
00:04:01,706 --> 00:04:03,833
<i>Yoshitani passed me the ball,</i>

56
00:04:03,917 --> 00:04:07,504
<i>Koike set a screen,
and I was able to get a clear shot.</i>

57
00:04:08,129 --> 00:04:10,840
<i>Then when I missed, you got the rebound.</i>

58
00:04:12,759 --> 00:04:14,344
And at that moment, I thought...

59
00:04:14,928 --> 00:04:17,389
I wanna keep playing ball like this
for forever.

60
00:04:22,727 --> 00:04:24,854
[Nagisa] You're asking for the impossible.

61
00:04:27,023 --> 00:04:28,483
Now then,

62
00:04:28,566 --> 00:04:30,235
up with you, young lady!

63
00:04:31,278 --> 00:04:33,697
You could have let me
lie down a little longer.

64
00:04:34,823 --> 00:04:37,284
You can't play ball
if you're not standing up!

65
00:04:38,201 --> 00:04:39,244
Look at your bracelet,

66
00:04:39,828 --> 00:04:41,496
you're gonna make it cry!

67
00:04:41,579 --> 00:04:42,455
[exclaims softly]

68
00:04:43,081 --> 00:04:44,499
[inaudible]

69
00:04:51,673 --> 00:04:55,051
[Chinatsu] It'll be fine.
I'll have my act together tomorrow.

70
00:04:55,135 --> 00:04:57,137
[Nagisa] If you don't, we're in trouble.

71
00:04:59,639 --> 00:05:01,766
[boy] Taiki, the court's all yours!

72
00:05:01,850 --> 00:05:02,851
Okay!

73
00:05:03,935 --> 00:05:07,272
In the end,
Hyodo took home the championship, huh?

74
00:05:07,897 --> 00:05:10,483
At least, Haryu lost his game
to the champion.

75
00:05:10,567 --> 00:05:12,986
No! Don't let him
overhear you saying that.

76
00:05:13,069 --> 00:05:14,279
- [whimpers]
- Huh?

77
00:05:18,199 --> 00:05:21,328
So now, girls' basketball's
the only team with a chance.

78
00:05:21,911 --> 00:05:23,788
Was their game at 4:00?

79
00:05:24,748 --> 00:05:26,374
What's the latest with Hina?

80
00:05:27,083 --> 00:05:28,168
How's she doing?

81
00:05:28,251 --> 00:05:31,129
Now that you mention it,
I haven't heard back from her.

82
00:05:31,212 --> 00:05:33,506
I did send her a text
before the competition.

83
00:05:34,632 --> 00:05:36,384
[Coach Yuasa] All right, everybody.

84
00:05:36,968 --> 00:05:39,387
The gym is scheduled for repairs today.

85
00:05:39,471 --> 00:05:42,557
So make sure that all of you
are out of here by four o'clock.

86
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:43,767
[all] Yes, sir.

87
00:05:52,275 --> 00:05:54,069
[Taiki] <i>I'm not
forgetting anything, right?</i>

88
00:05:54,152 --> 00:05:55,320
[gasps softly]

89
00:06:00,825 --> 00:06:03,119
<i>I wonder what Chinatsu's doing.</i>

90
00:06:03,203 --> 00:06:04,871
<i>Maybe she's warming up.</i>

91
00:06:10,919 --> 00:06:12,337
[yells]

92
00:06:12,962 --> 00:06:14,589
<i>That's not a good sign!</i>

93
00:06:14,672 --> 00:06:16,091
<i>I've got until 4:00.</i>

94
00:06:16,174 --> 00:06:18,218
<i>I have to score at least once!</i>

95
00:06:19,677 --> 00:06:20,929
[grunts]

96
00:06:21,763 --> 00:06:22,597
Huh?

97
00:06:33,149 --> 00:06:36,528
<i>It doesn't matter
what kind of "bad sign" I'm seeing.</i>

98
00:06:36,611 --> 00:06:38,363
<i>Chinatsu will make her shots.</i>

99
00:06:40,198 --> 00:06:44,202
<i>After all, she's been practicing non-stop
every single day.</i>

100
00:06:45,745 --> 00:06:47,080
<i>She's a year older than me,</i>

101
00:06:47,831 --> 00:06:49,582
<i>does things at her own speed,</i>

102
00:06:50,166 --> 00:06:52,627
<i>and has a weird sense of personal space.</i>

103
00:06:54,170 --> 00:06:56,381
<i>It can be hard to tell
what she's thinking,</i>

104
00:06:56,464 --> 00:06:58,883
<i>but not when she's embracing
her childlike side.</i>

105
00:07:00,760 --> 00:07:03,972
<i>She's sensitive and considerate,
almost to a fault,</i>

106
00:07:05,390 --> 00:07:07,350
<i>hates losing more than anything.</i>

107
00:07:08,935 --> 00:07:12,397
<i>And when she's playing basketball,
she looks so cool.</i>

108
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:15,442
<i>That's the Chinatsu who I...</i>

109
00:07:16,025 --> 00:07:17,652
<i>I... like.</i>

110
00:07:19,237 --> 00:07:20,405
[yells]

111
00:07:20,488 --> 00:07:22,073
[breathing heavily]

112
00:07:22,157 --> 00:07:23,908
<i>What the hell am I doing?</i>

113
00:07:23,992 --> 00:07:27,287
<i>Am I mumbling out the first draft
of my confession?</i>

114
00:07:28,955 --> 00:07:31,958
<i>I don't wanna hear myself
being all serious like that!</i>

115
00:07:32,041 --> 00:07:34,210
<i>Especially out in public!</i>

116
00:07:34,294 --> 00:07:35,920
[screams]

117
00:07:36,004 --> 00:07:39,924
<i>And I still can't get myself
to say any of this to her face!</i>

118
00:07:40,008 --> 00:07:41,885
[groans]

119
00:07:46,306 --> 00:07:49,517
<i>Oh, man, this bums me out
on so many levels.</i>

120
00:07:51,227 --> 00:07:52,937
[Hina] What's with all the commotion?

121
00:07:53,646 --> 00:07:54,522
[grunts]

122
00:07:55,565 --> 00:07:56,441
Hina!

123
00:07:56,524 --> 00:07:57,692
Hi!

124
00:07:59,277 --> 00:08:02,322
The gymnasium is closed off
for the rest of the day.

125
00:08:02,405 --> 00:08:03,698
Obviously.

126
00:08:03,781 --> 00:08:05,283
I only came because they told me

127
00:08:05,366 --> 00:08:08,077
to report my results
from nationals to the principal.

128
00:08:08,620 --> 00:08:11,956
[Taiki] Our school is really uptight
about that kinda thing, huh?

129
00:08:13,041 --> 00:08:15,126
So anyway, how'd you do?

130
00:08:15,210 --> 00:08:16,461
- Taiki!
- [grunts softly]

131
00:08:17,629 --> 00:08:18,963
Buy me <i>taiyaki.</i>

132
00:08:19,839 --> 00:08:20,798
<i>Taiyaki?</i>

133
00:08:24,177 --> 00:08:27,096
{\an8}[announcer on PA]
<i>The game between Minatozaki Academy</i>

134
00:08:27,180 --> 00:08:30,642
{\an8}<i>and Eimei Private High School
will now begin.</i>

135
00:08:31,601 --> 00:08:32,769
[blows whistle]

136
00:08:32,852 --> 00:08:34,270
[players] Let's play a good game!

137
00:08:41,361 --> 00:08:42,612
- [giggles]
- I was confused

138
00:08:42,695 --> 00:08:46,241
when you wanted <i>taiyaki</i> in the summer,
but I totally get it now.

139
00:08:46,324 --> 00:08:50,036
Red bean paste and soft-serve ice cream
are a match made in heaven!

140
00:08:50,703 --> 00:08:54,040
Nationals are over now,
so I get a cheat day!

141
00:08:56,167 --> 00:08:57,585
[exclaims]

142
00:08:57,669 --> 00:09:00,046
I can feel the sugar in my veins!

143
00:09:00,129 --> 00:09:01,005
Ah!

144
00:09:01,089 --> 00:09:03,383
[Taiki] <i>She isn't telling me
how she placed.</i>

145
00:09:03,466 --> 00:09:05,885
<i>Maybe she didn't do as well as she wanted.</i>

146
00:09:06,678 --> 00:09:09,556
<i>If she'd done well,
she would've told me first thing.</i>

147
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:12,642
<i>Maybe this is her stress-eating.</i>

148
00:09:13,476 --> 00:09:15,562
- By the way, I got third.
- Huh?

149
00:09:15,645 --> 00:09:16,771
Third place?

150
00:09:16,854 --> 00:09:18,565
I hadn't told you yet, so...

151
00:09:18,648 --> 00:09:20,441
I figured I should tell you how I did.

152
00:09:20,525 --> 00:09:22,569
[Taiki] <i>She's just gonna
drop it on me like that?</i>

153
00:09:22,652 --> 00:09:24,904
But getting third place is amazing!

154
00:09:25,530 --> 00:09:27,073
That's third in Japan, right?

155
00:09:27,156 --> 00:09:30,368
Do I look like someone
who'd be happy about this?

156
00:09:30,451 --> 00:09:31,494
My mistake.

157
00:09:33,037 --> 00:09:35,290
[Hina] I placed higher than last time,

158
00:09:35,373 --> 00:09:38,334
and I can recognize
that my performance has gotten better.

159
00:09:39,752 --> 00:09:42,505
But next time around, I'll place higher.

160
00:09:47,051 --> 00:09:48,219
I just think it's admirable

161
00:09:48,303 --> 00:09:50,471
that you're not letting the win
go to your head.

162
00:09:50,555 --> 00:09:54,809
But as an outsider, third place
is a huge accomplishment already,

163
00:09:54,892 --> 00:09:56,394
so let me do this for real...

164
00:09:58,771 --> 00:10:00,106
Congrats, Hina!

165
00:10:00,815 --> 00:10:01,649
[Hina] Hm.

166
00:10:02,358 --> 00:10:03,318
Thanks.

167
00:10:04,193 --> 00:10:05,111
[grunts softly]

168
00:10:06,112 --> 00:10:08,156
[Taiki] <i>Why is she making that face at me?</i>

169
00:10:08,698 --> 00:10:11,534
[chuckles] Let's go eat
at that park over there!

170
00:10:11,618 --> 00:10:12,619
Wait for me!

171
00:10:19,917 --> 00:10:22,670
<i>Right now,
they're probably in the third quarter.</i>

172
00:10:31,220 --> 00:10:33,139
MINATOZAKI - EIMEI

173
00:10:36,476 --> 00:10:38,561
That was so good!

174
00:10:38,645 --> 00:10:40,063
Thanks again, Taiki!

175
00:10:40,605 --> 00:10:41,731
You're welcome.

176
00:10:41,814 --> 00:10:42,649
[Hina gasps]

177
00:10:43,316 --> 00:10:45,735
The swings are open! [giggles]

178
00:10:48,279 --> 00:10:50,073
[laughing]

179
00:10:50,156 --> 00:10:52,283
[Taiki] <i>I'm glad she's having a good time.</i>

180
00:10:53,493 --> 00:10:54,410
[exclaims]

181
00:10:57,455 --> 00:10:58,539
Quit it!

182
00:10:59,207 --> 00:11:00,083
Hm?

183
00:11:00,625 --> 00:11:02,460
Uh... What for?

184
00:11:04,629 --> 00:11:06,923
- I almost saw your underwear.
- What?!

185
00:11:07,507 --> 00:11:09,300
I have shorts under my skirt!

186
00:11:09,384 --> 00:11:11,302
That isn't really the point, Hina!

187
00:11:11,386 --> 00:11:12,678
'Cause you're a girl!

188
00:11:12,762 --> 00:11:14,680
You gotta be careful about this stuff!

189
00:11:19,018 --> 00:11:20,186
Well, that's new.

190
00:11:20,812 --> 00:11:22,438
You treating me like a girl.

191
00:11:22,522 --> 00:11:24,190
I treat you like a girl.

192
00:11:24,732 --> 00:11:25,942
You are one.

193
00:11:33,366 --> 00:11:35,535
Are you checking the time?

194
00:11:35,618 --> 00:11:37,745
Uh, no, I wasn't...

195
00:11:38,287 --> 00:11:39,247
[gasps]

196
00:11:39,914 --> 00:11:42,959
Could it be that Chinatsu's game is today?

197
00:11:43,042 --> 00:11:43,918
Huh?

198
00:11:44,710 --> 00:11:46,212
Mm. Yeah, it is.

199
00:11:46,295 --> 00:11:47,213
[all cheering]

200
00:11:47,296 --> 00:11:49,465
[Taiki] <i>They must be
in the fourth quarter by now.</i>

201
00:11:52,427 --> 00:11:55,346
{\an8}<i>They're, apparently,
playing last year's champions.</i>

202
00:11:55,430 --> 00:11:58,099
<i>I've heard this game
is a big one for Eimei.</i>

203
00:11:59,392 --> 00:12:00,601
Yup. Yup.

204
00:12:04,313 --> 00:12:05,273
[grunts softly]

205
00:12:06,899 --> 00:12:08,109
Having said that,

206
00:12:08,734 --> 00:12:10,987
it's not as if I can do anything.

207
00:12:11,529 --> 00:12:13,197
[sighs] Okay.

208
00:12:13,281 --> 00:12:15,366
So let's compete in a shoe-toss!

209
00:12:15,450 --> 00:12:16,993
What's the connection?

210
00:12:17,076 --> 00:12:19,328
Since Chinatsu's competing right now,

211
00:12:19,412 --> 00:12:20,746
you should be competing too.

212
00:12:20,830 --> 00:12:22,039
That's the connection.

213
00:12:22,707 --> 00:12:24,375
Don't look at my undies, okay?

214
00:12:24,459 --> 00:12:25,751
Of course I won't.

215
00:12:26,335 --> 00:12:27,336
If you lose,

216
00:12:27,420 --> 00:12:31,007
you have to tell me something
that you haven't told anyone.

217
00:12:31,090 --> 00:12:32,008
What?

218
00:12:32,091 --> 00:12:34,010
Wait, we're betting on this game?

219
00:12:34,093 --> 00:12:36,053
[Hina] And I already know
about training camp

220
00:12:36,137 --> 00:12:37,972
during the first year of junior high.

221
00:12:38,055 --> 00:12:39,474
[Taiki] Don't bring that up!

222
00:12:41,976 --> 00:12:43,019
Okay, you go first.

223
00:12:44,145 --> 00:12:46,314
[Taiki] <i>It's good she's having fun, but...</i>

224
00:12:47,565 --> 00:12:50,943
<i>I don't know... There's something different
about Hina today.</i>

225
00:12:52,361 --> 00:12:53,738
[hopeful music playing]

226
00:12:57,241 --> 00:12:58,159
[Chinatsu grunts]

227
00:13:04,123 --> 00:13:05,416
Some serious air.

228
00:13:06,667 --> 00:13:07,835
What an amateur!

229
00:13:07,919 --> 00:13:10,546
The whole point is to try
to get it to go far, not high.

230
00:13:11,172 --> 00:13:14,050
[chuckles] Are you an expert or something?

231
00:13:14,133 --> 00:13:15,384
[all cheering]

232
00:13:17,011 --> 00:13:18,304
EIMEI

233
00:13:19,805 --> 00:13:20,932
MINATOZAKI

234
00:13:21,641 --> 00:13:22,517
'Kay!

235
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:23,684
My turn now!

236
00:13:23,768 --> 00:13:25,102
[Chinatsu panting]

237
00:13:29,190 --> 00:13:30,358
Natsu!

238
00:13:31,150 --> 00:13:33,277
You don't have to go easy on me.

239
00:13:36,572 --> 00:13:37,782
[Nagisa] Let's go!

240
00:13:38,950 --> 00:13:40,117
[Hina] I've got this!

241
00:13:45,790 --> 00:13:46,958
[music stops]

242
00:13:51,963 --> 00:13:55,883
- [buzzer sounds]
- [ball thudding]

243
00:13:55,967 --> 00:13:57,885
[all cheering]

244
00:14:04,267 --> 00:14:06,227
[Hina] I've never told anyone this, but...

245
00:14:13,484 --> 00:14:14,527
I like you.

246
00:14:20,241 --> 00:14:22,660
{\an8}- [buzzer sounds]
- [all cheering]

247
00:14:24,745 --> 00:14:25,955
[laughing]

248
00:14:28,749 --> 00:14:30,334
[panting]

249
00:14:39,260 --> 00:14:40,595
[whimpers]

250
00:14:47,059 --> 00:14:48,436
[sobbing]

251
00:14:51,522 --> 00:14:53,441
[Chinatsu] <i>It didn't come true.</i>

252
00:14:54,692 --> 00:14:56,569
<i>My wish didn't come true.</i>

253
00:15:08,456 --> 00:15:09,999
I like you, Taiki.

254
00:15:11,292 --> 00:15:12,543
Um... uh...

255
00:15:13,878 --> 00:15:14,879
In, like, a...

256
00:15:16,172 --> 00:15:17,423
romantic way?

257
00:15:18,841 --> 00:15:19,967
A romantic way.

258
00:15:21,052 --> 00:15:22,386
[laughs]

259
00:15:22,470 --> 00:15:24,972
As your best friend,
I caught you unawares, huh?

260
00:15:25,056 --> 00:15:28,142
I mean, honestly,
I, for one, was surprised by this, too.

261
00:15:28,684 --> 00:15:30,353
I was like, "Really? Taiki?"

262
00:15:30,436 --> 00:15:31,395
You know?

263
00:15:31,479 --> 00:15:33,481
So in your face! Surprise!

264
00:15:34,065 --> 00:15:34,982
[gasps softly]

265
00:15:35,066 --> 00:15:37,193
- [sizzles]
- What is that look?

266
00:15:38,569 --> 00:15:40,321
It's just out of nowhere.

267
00:15:40,404 --> 00:15:43,074
I don't know what to think,
I'm pretty caught off-guard.

268
00:15:43,157 --> 00:15:46,994
And this is the first time someone's
confessed their feelings to me.

269
00:15:47,578 --> 00:15:49,580
I'm just blushing over here.

270
00:15:53,709 --> 00:15:56,003
It's just completely out of left field.

271
00:15:57,964 --> 00:15:59,006
[chuckles softly]

272
00:15:59,882 --> 00:16:02,885
Look, I know that you have
feelings for Chinatsu.

273
00:16:04,720 --> 00:16:06,806
So I don't need an answer right away.

274
00:16:09,392 --> 00:16:13,062
It's just... I didn't think
anything would change unless I told you.

275
00:16:14,605 --> 00:16:16,941
So stop looking at me as your best friend.

276
00:16:17,525 --> 00:16:19,944
From now on,
see me as a girl who likes you.

277
00:16:21,737 --> 00:16:22,738
[Taiki gasps]

278
00:16:28,035 --> 00:16:30,454
[Hina] Well, that's that,
so I'm heading home!

279
00:16:30,538 --> 00:16:31,539
[Taiki] Huh?

280
00:16:33,624 --> 00:16:37,003
You can buy me a parfait
if I place first next year!

281
00:16:37,086 --> 00:16:38,796
[Taiki] Uh, Hina!

282
00:16:39,714 --> 00:16:41,674
[happy piano music playing]

283
00:16:53,894 --> 00:16:56,272
- [vending machine clanging]
- [coin jingling]

284
00:16:58,399 --> 00:16:59,358
[beeps]

285
00:16:59,442 --> 00:17:00,443
[clattering]

286
00:17:09,285 --> 00:17:10,453
[groans]

287
00:17:10,536 --> 00:17:13,330
<i>Having someone confess to me
has my heart pounding.</i>

288
00:17:13,956 --> 00:17:15,249
<i>Hina likes me...</i>

289
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:17,835
<i>Were there signs that I missed?</i>

290
00:17:18,627 --> 00:17:20,463
<i>And how long has she liked me?</i>

291
00:17:23,716 --> 00:17:28,054
<i>Did she already have feelings for me
when we went to the fireworks festival?</i>

292
00:17:39,482 --> 00:17:41,817
[gasps] Say that again!

293
00:17:41,901 --> 00:17:44,111
[groans]

294
00:17:45,029 --> 00:17:49,742
<i>When I think that she already...
liked me at that point,</i>

295
00:17:50,326 --> 00:17:53,120
[sighs] <i>it feels like
a sucker punch to the chest.</i>

296
00:17:53,871 --> 00:17:57,500
<i>Knowing what I know now,
I've been kind of a jerk, huh?</i>

297
00:17:58,709 --> 00:18:00,669
<i>And maybe then too?</i>

298
00:18:01,962 --> 00:18:02,838
That's what...

299
00:18:04,465 --> 00:18:05,800
[Hina grunts hesitatingly]

300
00:18:07,343 --> 00:18:09,261
that's what makes you great.

301
00:18:14,433 --> 00:18:15,684
[Taiki] <i>Hina's great.</i>

302
00:18:16,602 --> 00:18:19,980
<i>As a friend, an athlete, and a person.</i>

303
00:18:20,606 --> 00:18:24,401
<i>She's easy to talk to, earnest,
and someone I can respect.</i>

304
00:18:25,236 --> 00:18:27,947
<i>And that describes the person who...</i>

305
00:18:28,864 --> 00:18:30,449
[groans]

306
00:18:35,246 --> 00:18:36,080
INOMATA

307
00:18:36,163 --> 00:18:39,583
- Don't do that where people can see you.
- And what is it you think I'm doing?

308
00:18:39,667 --> 00:18:42,044
- Strength training?
- That's not what I'm doing.

309
00:18:43,963 --> 00:18:44,839
I'm back!

310
00:18:44,922 --> 00:18:49,552
[Taiki] <i>I don't want my mom to see me
while I'm agonizing over romantic stuff.</i>

311
00:18:51,846 --> 00:18:53,931
Oh, I got a text, by the way.

312
00:18:56,892 --> 00:18:58,144
From Chinatsu.

313
00:18:58,227 --> 00:18:59,687
They lost their game.

314
00:19:00,521 --> 00:19:02,148
[sad piano music playing]

315
00:19:04,525 --> 00:19:05,568
[Taiki gasps softly]

316
00:19:09,321 --> 00:19:10,573
[gasps softly]

317
00:19:12,449 --> 00:19:15,411
When she gets back,
tell her we know she gave it her all.

318
00:19:16,912 --> 00:19:17,913
[Taiki] Yeah.

319
00:19:23,294 --> 00:19:25,921
CHINATSU

320
00:19:38,309 --> 00:19:39,518
[Taiki] <i>What's going on?</i>

321
00:19:41,020 --> 00:19:42,771
<i>I haven't done anything wrong,</i>

322
00:19:44,315 --> 00:19:46,317
<i>so why do I feel so guilty?</i>

323
00:19:49,320 --> 00:19:52,072
<i>I don't even know how I'm supposed to act...</i>

324
00:19:52,907 --> 00:19:54,408
<i>the next time I see her.</i>

325
00:20:07,129 --> 00:20:10,299
[Taiki] <i>What a relief.
Gymnastics has the day off today.</i>

326
00:20:11,675 --> 00:20:15,721
<i>If I ran into Hina right now,
I don't think I could look her in the eye.</i>

327
00:20:16,513 --> 00:20:18,307
<i>I just need a little time to...</i>

328
00:20:20,684 --> 00:20:21,560
[gasps softly]

329
00:20:26,815 --> 00:20:27,733
[sighs]

330
00:20:29,443 --> 00:20:30,486
[Hina] Here we go!

331
00:20:32,988 --> 00:20:34,156
[groans]

332
00:20:40,913 --> 00:20:43,249
Hey! What are you looking at?

333
00:20:43,332 --> 00:20:46,210
You're standing at the entrance,
there's nowhere else to look!

334
00:20:46,293 --> 00:20:47,962
Plus, you don't have practice today.

335
00:20:48,045 --> 00:20:49,964
Well, I didn't come here for practice.

336
00:20:50,923 --> 00:20:52,049
[exhales]

337
00:20:52,132 --> 00:20:54,093
You could have
just announced yourself, you know.

338
00:20:54,677 --> 00:20:55,844
It's not that easy!

339
00:20:55,928 --> 00:20:57,429
Uh-huh. And why's that?

340
00:20:58,013 --> 00:20:59,556
It's, because, you know...

341
00:21:07,940 --> 00:21:09,108
[Hina] Ah, yes.

342
00:21:09,817 --> 00:21:11,151
You sit on that, Taiki.

343
00:21:12,444 --> 00:21:15,406
Every time you see me from now on,
your heart should skip a beat.

344
00:21:15,489 --> 00:21:17,116
It's not gonna skip a beat.

345
00:21:21,287 --> 00:21:22,621
Even if it doesn't,

346
00:21:23,497 --> 00:21:25,582
that's fine, as long as it reminds you...

347
00:21:26,166 --> 00:21:27,626
that I have a crush on you.

348
00:21:28,210 --> 00:21:29,211
[Taiki gasps]

349
00:21:31,046 --> 00:21:33,257
Your heart skipped a beat just now.

350
00:21:33,340 --> 00:21:34,883
No, it did not!

351
00:21:35,509 --> 00:21:36,719
Excellent.

352
00:21:36,802 --> 00:21:39,305
Seems like my confession
was pretty effective.

353
00:21:39,388 --> 00:21:41,890
[Taiki] What? Don't say that out loud!

354
00:22:05,539 --> 00:22:07,541
[closing theme song playing]
